y","frequency_rule":"RRULE:FREQ=DAILY","member_can_add":false,"next_level_id":null},{"id":"8ba3035e-a61f-4458-b078-9918624b8b18","pillar":"nutrition","card_kind":null,"duration_min":null,"title":"Protein at breakfast","title_fr":"Des protéines au petit-déjeuner","description":"Eggs, skyr, leftovers — anything. Steadier energy before 11:00.","description_fr":"Œufs, skyr, restes — peu importe. Une énergie plus stable jusqu’à 11 h.","easy_title":"Anything at breakfast counts","easy_title_fr":"Tout ce que vous mangez au petit-déjeuner compte","easy_description":"A short-night version that still moves you forward.","easy_description_fr":"La version des nuits courtes, qui vous fait quand même avancer.","rev_title":null,"rev_title_fr":null,"rev_description":null,"rev_description_fr":null,"how_md":null,"how_md_fr":null,"general_why":null,"general_why_fr":null,"image_url":null,"image_alt":null,"resources":[],"default_slot":"morning","frequency_rule":"RRULE:FREQ=DAILY","member_can_add":false,"next_level_id":null},{"id":"b6cabb08-565b-4f13-8350-7bbc981fa232","pillar":"nutrition","card_kind":null,"duration_min":null,"title":"Vegetables on half the plate","title_fr":"Des légumes sur la moitié de l’assiette","description":"One plate a day where vegetables win the territory.","description_fr":"Une assiette par jour où les légumes ont le dessus.","easy_title":null,"easy_title_fr":null,"easy_description":null,"easy_description_fr":null,"rev_title":null,"rev_title_fr":null,"rev_description":null,"rev_description_fr":null,"how_md":null,"how_md_fr":null,"general_why":null,"general_why_fr":null,"image_url":null,"image_alt":null,"resources":[],"default_slot":"midday","frequency_rule":"RRULE:FREQ=DAILY","member_can_add":false,"next_level_id":null},{"id":"d76c26e1-2e7c-42f8-8ea1-204413c96916","pillar":"sleep","card_kind":null,"duration_min":null,"title":"Screens off 30 minutes before bed","title_fr":"Écrans éteints 30 minutes avant le coucher","description":"Give the mind a runway.","description_fr":"Offrez à l’esprit une piste d’atterrissage.","easy_title":"Phone out of the bedroom","easy_title_fr":"Le téléphone hors de la chambre","easy_description":"Distance does the work for you.","easy_description_fr":"La distance fait le travail à votre place.","rev_title":null,"rev_title_fr":null,"rev_description":null,"rev_description_fr":null,"how_md":null,"how_md_fr":null,"general_why":null,"general_why_fr":null,"image_url":null,"image_alt":null,"resources":[],"default_slot":"evening","frequency_rule":"RRULE:FREQ=DAILY","member_can_add":false,"next_level_id":"47613f35-cb86-4122-b168-ea3135a7a208"},{"id":"47613f35-cb86-4122-b168-ea3135a7a208","pillar":"sleep","card_kind":"routine","duration_min":null,"title":"Screens off 60 minutes before bed","title_fr":"Écrans éteints 60 minutes avant le coucher","description":"A full hour without screens before you sleep.","description_fr":"Une heure entière sans écrans avant de dormir.","easy_title":"Thirty minutes tonight","easy_title_fr":"Trente minutes ce soir","easy_description":"Busy evening? Screens off 30 minutes before bed still counts.","easy_description_fr":"Soirée chargée ? Éteindre les écrans 30 minutes avant le coucher compte quand même.","rev_title":null,"rev_title_fr":null,"rev_description":null,"rev_description_fr":null,"how_md":"1. Set your screens-off time: one hour before you go to bed.\n2. At that time, stop reading, watching and scrolling on your phone, laptop, tablet and TV.\n3. Leave screens outside the bedroom for the night.\n4. If you really need a screen, turn the brightness down and switch on its warm or red display mode.\n5. Fill the hour with something calm on paper, such as a printed book under a dim lamp.","how_md_fr":"1. Fixez votre heure d’extinction des écrans : une heure avant le coucher.\n2. À ce moment-là, arrêtez de lire, de regarder et de faire défiler sur le téléphone, l’ordinateur, la tablette et la télévision.\n3. Laissez les écrans hors de la chambre pour la nuit.\n4. Si un écran est vraiment nécessaire, baissez la luminosité et activez son mode d’affichage chaud ou rouge.\n5. Occupez cette heure avec quelque chose de calme sur papier, comme un livre imprimé sous une lampe tamisée.","general_why":"Screens give off bright light that can tell your body clock it is still daytime, and their messages and feeds keep the mind busy just when it needs to settle. A full hour without them gives both the light and your attention time to wind down.","general_why_fr":"Les écrans émettent une lumière vive qui peut faire croire à votre horloge interne qu’il fait encore jour, et leurs messages et fils d’actualité occupent l’esprit au moment où il devrait se poser. Une heure entière sans eux laisse à la lumière et à l’attention le temps de redescendre.","image_url":null,"image_alt":null,"resources":[{"kind":"article","slug":"ecrans-melatonine","title":"Écrans & mélatonine"}],"default_slot":"evening","frequency_rule":"RRULE:FREQ=DAILY","member_can_add":true,"next_level_id":null},{"id":"7dede76d-132c-4274-9812-3edba28dfb62","pillar":"nutrition","card_kind":"routine","duration_min":null,"title":"Kitchen closed 3 hours before bed","title_fr":"Cuisine fermée 3 heures avant le coucher","description":"Your last meal or snack at least three hours before you go to bed.","description_fr":"Votre dernier repas ou en-cas au moins trois heures avant le coucher.","easy_title":"Two hours tonight","easy_title_fr":"Deux heures ce soir","easy_description":"A late evening? Closing the kitchen two hours before bed still counts.","easy_description_fr":"Une soirée tardive ? Fermer la cuisine deux heures avant le coucher compte quand même.","rev_title":null,"rev_title_fr":null,"rev_description":null,"rev_description_fr":null,"how_md":"1. Work out your closing time: three hours before your usual bedtime.\n2. Have your last meal or snack before that time.\n3. Mark the close: put the food away and switch off the kitchen light.\n4. Keep your meal times fairly regular from day to day, without being strict about it.\n5. If you do eat late one evening, just notice it — tomorrow is a normal day.","how_md_fr":"1. Calculez votre heure de fermeture : trois heures avant votre heure habituelle de coucher.\n2. Prenez votre dernier repas ou en-cas avant cette heure.\n3. Marquez la fermeture : rangez la nourriture et éteignez la lumière de la cuisine.\n4. Gardez des heures de repas assez régulières d’un jour à l’autre, sans rigidité.\n5. Si vous mangez tard un soir, remarquez-le simplement — demain est un jour normal.","general_why":"A regular rhythm of meals that ends a few hours before bed gives your evening a clear end to eating. Tying the closing time to your bedtime keeps that rhythm whatever time you go to sleep.","general_why_fr":"Un rythme de repas régulier, qui s’arrête quelques heures avant le coucher, donne à la soirée une fin claire pour manger. Lier l’heure de fermeture à votre heure de coucher garde ce rythme, quelle que soit l’heure à laquelle vous dormez.","image_url":null,"image_alt":null,"resources":[],"default_slot":"evening","frequency_rule":"RRULE:FREQ=DAILY","member_can_add":true,"next_level_id":null}]
